<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>YN Export India - Register</title>

<style>

body{
margin:0;
padding:0;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:#f2f4f8;
}

.container{
max-width:520px;
margin:30px auto;
background:#fff;
padding:25px;
border-radius:10px;
box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}

h2{
text-align:center;
color:#1565c0;
margin-bottom:5px;
}

p.top{
text-align:center;
color:#666;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

label{
font-weight:bold;
display:block;
margin-top:12px;
margin-bottom:5px;
}

input,
select,
textarea{
width:100%;
padding:10px;
border:1px solid #ccc;
border-radius:5px;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

button{
width:100%;
padding:12px;
margin-top:20px;
background:#1565c0;
color:white;
border:none;
border-radius:5px;
font-size:16px;
cursor:pointer;
}

button:hover{
background:#0d47a1;
}

.help{
background:#eef7ff;
padding:10px;
border-radius:5px;
margin-bottom:15px;
font-size:14px;
}

.errorlist{
color:red;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h2>YN Export India</h2>

<p class="top">
Create Your Account
</p>

<div class="help">
Referral ID होने पर दर्ज करें। नहीं है तो खाली छोड़ सकते हैं।
</div>

<form method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">

{% csrf_token %}

{{ form.as_p }}
<button type="submit">
Register Now
</button>

</form>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:20px;">

Already have an account?

<br><br>

<a href="{% url 'login' %}">
Login Here
</a>

<br><br>

<a href="{% url 'home' %}">
🏠 Back to Home
</a>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
